  "temperament": "aggressive",
  "description": "An unnaturally powerful ladybug. They are resistant to the flavor of their mutation.",
  "behavior": "Its night spawn only unlocks after releasing the O.G.R.Rs. in the Scarecrow Lab. After that it appears at night on top of the Picnic Table and marches straight at you far more insistently than the normal ladybug.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is less of a passive threat and more of a moving mass that forces repositioning every few seconds. Ignore it for too long and it steals exactly the space you needed for the rest of the wave.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It fits perfectly as the front line of an O.G.R.R. wave. It soaks attention, blocks short paths, and gives the rest of the variants room to punish from behind or from the sides.",
  "strategy": "Fresh and busting still help, but here it matters even more to isolate it before other variants start feeding off its frontal pressure. Once it pins you in place, the rest of the group is already fighting with the advantage.",
  "environments": [
    "After releasing the O.G.R.Rs. in the Scarecrow Lab",
    "On top of the Picnic Table"
  ],
